The Claude Code package references one third-party project for the behaviour
of `claude` as a child process. No source file of it is included.

yetone/magpie, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 yetone:
driving the installed `claude` over stream-json with its built-in tools off,
the MCP relay for the caller's tools, and the variables that keep the user's
settings, memory and connectors out of the process. Its code injection into
the binary, request rewriting, credential and keychain reads, saved accounts,
permission bypass and downloaded builds are not used.

